one. The second determinant could be the business ownership. Business owners age out and choose to sell the business due to wealth accumulation or the desire to&amp;nbsp;...</dc:description><dc:format>320 pages</dc:format><dc:format>book</dc:format><dc:identifier>Doj5Njd0u8gC</dc:identifier><dc:identifier>ISBN:9780071780322</dc:identifier><dc:identifier>ISBN:0071780327</dc:identifier><dc:language>en</dc:language><gbs:price type='SuggestedRetailPrice'><gd:money amount='2528.79' currencyCode='INR'/></gbs:price><gbs:price type='RetailPrice'><gd:money amount='2528.79' currencyCode='INR'/></gbs:price><dc:publisher>McGraw Hill Professional</dc:publisher><dc:subject>Business &amp; Economics</dc:subject><dc:title>Get Financing Now: How to Navigate Through Bankers, Investors, and Alternative Sources for the Capital Your Business Needs</dc:title></entry><entry><id>http://www.google.com/books/feeds/volumes/nCTof0yUWwAC</id><updated>2026-09-25T12:33:10.000Z</updated><category scheme='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#kind' term='http://schemas.google.com/books/2008#volume'/><title type='text'>Art in America</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/books/2008/thumbnail' type='image/x-unknown' href='http://books.google.com/books/content?id=nCTof0yUWwAC&amp;printsec=frontcover&amp;img=1&amp;zoom=5&amp;source=gbs_gdata'/><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/books/2008/info' type='text/html' href='http://books.google.com/books?id=nCTof0yUWwAC&amp;dq=%22wal-mart%22+%22five-and-dime%22&amp;source=gbs_gdata'/><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/books/2008/preview' type='text/html' href='http://books.google.com/books?id=nCTof0yUWwAC&amp;q=%22wal-mart%22+%22five-and-dime%22&amp;dq=%22wal-mart%22+%22five-and-dime%22&amp;cd=6&amp;source=gbs_gdata'/><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/books/2008/annotation' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.google.com/books/feeds/users/me/volumes'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://books.google.com/books?id=nCTof0yUWwAC&amp;